Found while building PR #282 (#227 part 2):

- `npm run desktop:build` fails if the checkout has a `.data/` folder. Code in `lib/ai/chatgpt.ts`, `lib/ai/claude.ts` and `lib/bank/return-listener.ts` builds a path into `.data` in a way that makes Next.js trace the whole folder into the standalone server build. CI has no `.data/`, so this only breaks local desktop builds. Fix the dynamic paths at the cause, for example with `/*turbopackIgnore: true*/` per AGENTS.md → Desktop app.
- The Settings page renders two elements with `id="voice"`.

